e followers are close.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4x8GcNxt8rChGAPCm57TtY13Fxx.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-09\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":23,\"name\":\"When the Dead Walk\",\"overview\":\"Pingjing is stabbed by a traitor with ties to a long-forgotten royal scandal.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kIe0zTRzdxsiF7zBgLfjXVKlQB8.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-10\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":24,\"name\":\"Unlocking Frostbone\",\"overview\":\"Only a rare poison cure can save Pingjing—Puyang holds the key.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lTwM1eCR2qd2WJVi4pEZ1qHeaf8.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-10\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":25,\"name\":\"The Brother's Resolve\",\"overview\":\"Pingzhang faces a deadly trap to retrieve the cure—and chooses to risk it all.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/peyTBzzmBtbFNgm8AT8KjkdGodU.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-15\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":26,\"name\":\"Together, Always\",\"overview\":\"The cure is shared—Pingzhang survives. But a greater war looms on the horizon.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cFF468bOJ8MAOfB3YxuQuhBu9Bc.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-15\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":27,\"name\":\"That Day\",\"overview\":\"Pingzhang saves his father from an ambush—but his body can no longer hold on.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uHQUItrlR73fVJ5F764JlQJNIHF.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-16\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":28,\"name\":\"Worry for the Future\",\"overview\":\"A new emperor rises, but danger brews as Pingjing is promoted amid growing unease.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tUfZnii8EFZ1CZahTklizwhggdg.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-16\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":29,\"name\":\"Inherited Will\",\"overview\":\"The Chang Lin legacy continues—but enemies move to reclaim control of court power.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A4ilHHy419GzjVQDCd7AaXJhY73.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-17\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":30,\"name\":\"The New Emperor's Message\",\"overview\":\"Pingjing prepares for peace talks while the empress plots a power shift.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/islKvIYzWEuLqpy6ewYvqN5yp5j.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-17\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":31,\"name\":\"In Enemy Territory\",\"overview\":\"Pingjing infiltrates Dayu’s stronghold to expose their plan for war.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kUPAFs7KWLuglYq5h20WBnWyJIp.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-22\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":32,\"name\":\"Betrayal\",\"overview\":\"Pingjing’s war strategy is leaked—Yuanqi betrays him to the court.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/YU3oBovyIMxIZLjnvd5U4CXJDV.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-22\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":33,\"name\":\"The Secret Decree\",\"overview\":\"Tingsheng backs Pingjing’s war—but the emperor’s decree forbids all action.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oMwmC9Zz8RwEpchSImiEwOilOIM.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-23\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":34,\"name\":\"The Final Battle\",\"overview\":\"Despite imperial orders, Pingjing leads a brilliant ambush as war erupts.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/30VfFZUz4jXdAvKN5ICvnf7LXug.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-23\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":35,\"name\":\"The Unwavering Path\",\"overview\":\"Pingjing wins the battle—but promises to face judgment for his defiance.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9ufesGUOj9G62T9IshC9KdX3vD7.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-24\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":36,\"name\":\"Final Remonstration\",\"overview\":\"Tingsheng dies after defending Pingjing in court, sealing a father’s love.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qMtHOkkcTRraxPmKHlJdo7KBM0Q.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-24\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":37,\"name\":\"The Soul Returns\",\"overview\":\"With Tingsheng gone, Pingjing is exiled—and the Chang Lin army is disbanded.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6YSyco8sP0Ws8V6yTaLqJlw7Ozw.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-29\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":38,\"name\":\"The Pact\",\"overview\":\"Yuanqi strikes a secret deal to become a war hero—at a terrible cost.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4WNX6XGFrq3AlRzO9M1oJ3V8vRh.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-29\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":39,\"name\":\"The Obsidian Sword\",\"overview\":\"Yuanqi hides his pact with Mozi—but his secret is nearly exposed.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/u2DfL0nHqgae4gG1kVDpqoefE2R.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-30\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":40,\"name\":\"Ambitions Accelerate\",\"overview\":\"Yuanqi manipulates court ranks while Pingjing grows suspicious from afar.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lB9YkeqbrkqEvsURhPQi9yDH15x.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-30\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":41,\"name\":\"Reunion with a Friend\",\"overview\":\"Yuanqi visits Pingjing—asking advice while hiding a deeper agenda.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/skwpkZqePGEvkFRqcMNLcJiAYBD.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-31\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":42,\"name\":\"False Hero\",\"overview\":\"Yuanqi’s wife learns the truth—while Pingjing warns the capital of danger.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yF2afUbdyHq87BzBG1DGzKcwIsA.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-31\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":43,\"name\":\"The Accusation\",\"overview\":\"Pingjing confesses love; Pei’er’s wit